>**{c=red:If you have any other }{n:Borghertz's|Borghertz}{c=red: Hands quest active, you must complete that one before you can start this quest!}**
=2 Walkthrough
Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with {n:Guslam} located at (H-8) on {p:Dark Knight} to begin the quest.
* Go to {z:The Eldieme Necropolis}
** {n:Churano-Shurano} {z:Windurst Waters} (F-8), you can purchase a Permanent Key Item: {k:Magicked astrolabe} for 10,000 Gil. This allows you to open doors in {z:The Eldieme Necropolis} solo.
* Either obtain an {i:Eldieme Necropolis Coffer Key|Eld. Coffer Key|1046} or pick the lock as a {p:Thief}.

:* **You do not need to be on Dark Knight when opening the coffer.**

* You will receive a {p:key item|Key Item} {k:Old gauntlets} from the coffer.
* Return to {z:Upper Jeuno} and speak to {n:Guslam}. He will inform you he is unable to repair the gauntlets.
* If this is your first time completing a Boghertz's Hands quest for any job, you must do the following:

:* Speak to {n:Deadly Minnow} inside of the Durable Shields shop.
:* Head to {z:Lower Jeuno} inside the Tenshodo area. Speak with {n:Yin Pocanakhu} at (J-8) and then trade 1,000 gil to continue.

* Go to {z:Port Jeuno} and head to the crates near the AH and Jeuno Duty-Free Shop at (H-8).
* Click on the ??? to receive a cutscene.
* Travel to {z:Castle Zvahl Baileys} and go to (F-8) on the first map.
* Click on one of the torches to spawn {m:Dark Spark}.
* Once {m:Dark Spark} is defeated, examine the same torch you used to spawn it. You will receive the {p:key item|Key Item} {k:Shadow flames}.
* Return to Port Jeuno and examine the ??? again. After the cutscene, the quest is complete.

=2 Two Additional Coffers
{n:Guslam} mentions that there is still armor scattered about Vana'diel. You can find two more pieces of armor by opening coffers in the following zones with the corresponding coffer key:
* {z:Monastic Cavern} - {@i:Chaos Flanchard|14221} {i:Chaos Flanchard|Chaos Flanchard|14221} - {z:Monastic Cavern}
* {z:Castle Oztroja} - {@i:Chaos Cuirass|12645} {i:Chaos Cuirass|Chaos Cuirass|12645} - {z:Castle Oztroja}
** These coffers are not required to complete the quest, therefore after you receive your hands the quest is "completed".
** The quest must either be active or completed in order to receive these attire pieces.
** You **must** have {p:Dark Knight} as your main job when you open these coffers.

